randomboubles_research_name.RBAPPRENTICERINGOFAER=A Ring of Air
randomboubles_research_text.RBAPPRENTICERINGOFAER=A Circle of Solid Air Magic.
randomboubles_research_page.RBAPPRENTICERINGOFAER.1=While traveling the world, you have found a Ring that seems to have a high affinity with Air Magic. <BR>There must exist more rings that have different affinites.<BR><BR>I wonder what would happen if i researched them all...
randomboubles_research_name.RBMAGICIANSRINGOFAER=Magician's Air Ring
randomboubles_research_text.RBMAGICIANSRINGOFAER=A Sliver of Solidifed Air.
randomboubles_research_page.RBMAGICIANSRINGOFAER.1=By imbuing The ring with even more Air Magic, you have managed to find a way of making the ring even stronger. <BR><BR>There must exist other ways of making the ring even more powerful...
randomboubles_research_name.RBARCHMAGESRINGOFAER=The Archmage's Air Ring
randomboubles_research_text.RBARCHMAGESRINGOFAER=A Circle of Crystallized Air.
randomboubles_research_page.RBARCHMAGESRINGOFAER.1=A breakthrough in magical imbuement has allowed you to find a way to empower the ring even more. <BR><BR>I think this is the end, unless you can bend the energies of creation itself...
randomboubles_research_name.RBMASTERSRINGOFAER=The Master Mage's Air Ring
randomboubles_research_text.RBMASTERSRINGOFAER=A Circle of Primordial Air.
randomboubles_research_page.RBMASTERSRINGOFAER.1=A surprising find, the Pearl seems to buckle reality itself, it seems to be a perfect component for strengthening the ring one final time.

